<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;">
    <p><%t XD\MagicLinkLogin\Email\VerificationCode.INTRO 'Here is your verification code:' %></p>
    <p style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.3em;">$Code</p>
    <p><%t XD\MagicLinkLogin\Email\VerificationCode.EXPIRY_NOTE 'This code will expire shortly. If you did not request this, you can ignore this email.' %></p>
</body>
</html>
